GAL16V8
ECBSD21
; SD card U2 (ATF16V8B): ports C0-CF, Pico handshake, WAIT* as emulated open drain.
A7 A6 A5 A4 IORQ_N RD_N WR_N M1_N ACK GND
EN_N WAIT_N SELRD SELWR BUF_OE_N NC NC NC NC VCC

SELRD = A7*A6*/A5*/A4*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/EN_N*/RD_N
SELWR = A7*A6*/A5*/A4*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/EN_N*/WR_N
/BUF_OE_N = A7*A6*/A5*/A4*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/EN_N*/RD_N + A7*A6*/A5*/A4*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/EN_N*/WR_N
WAIT_N.T = GND
WAIT_N.E = A7*A6*/A5*/A4*/IORQ_N*M1_N*/EN_N*/ACK

DESCRIPTION
ECB SD card decoder. Source of truth: ecb_sd_decode.pld (rev 2.1).
